This folder holds bbhost's files for its Linux build of AMD's FidelityFX
library, libbbhost_fidelityfx_vk.so: FSR 3 upscaling on Vulkan, which bbhost
loads at run time beside its executable (src/host/upscaler_ffx.cpp) as the
Windows build uses AMD's signed amd_fidelityfx_*_vk.dll. The licence above
covers the files in this folder.

The library is built from AMD FidelityFX SDK v2.4.0's own source - the
FidelityFX API, its Vulkan backend and the FSR 3 upscaler - fetched pinned by
tools/fetch_fidelityfx.sh, MIT, Copyright (C) Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
(the SDK's Kits/FidelityFX/docs/license.md, also third_party/fidelityfx/
LICENSE-signedbin.md), with its shaders compiled by tools/ffx_permutations.py
and the changes in third_party/fidelityfx/patches. AMD's code is not in this
repository. The built library is under those MIT terms; bbhost is not
sponsored or endorsed by AMD.
